DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
17372::$$$message_0131_0000_0000$$$::I arrive at the shopping district.[lr]::
17373::$$$message_0131_0000_0001$$$::It's still early for preparing for lunch, but as I'm looking around to see if there's any sales...[lr]::
17374::$$$message_0131_0000_0002$$$::I coincidentally find Sakura.[lr]::
17375::$$$message_0131_0000_0003$$$::Good timing. I'll ask her about today's menu...::
17376::$$$message_0131_0001_0000$$$::"...Huh?"[lr]::
17377::$$$message_0131_0001_0001$$$::I stop and see who she's with.[lr]::
17378::$$$message_0131_0001_0002$$$::There's no doubt.[lr]::
17379::$$$message_0131_0001_0003$$$::...It's Caster and Sakura.[lr]::
17380::$$$message_0131_0001_0004$$$::I've been seeing Caster around lately, but it's rare that she's with someone.::
17381::$$$message_0131_0002_0000$$$::"Oh, Senpai!"[lr]::
17382::$$$message_0131_0002_0001$$$::Sakura looks back and calls to me happily.[lr]::
17383::$$$message_0131_0002_0002$$$::"Well, if it isn't Emiya? Good day."::
17384::$$$message_0131_0003_0000$$$::...She didn't call me "boy."[lr]::
17385::$$$message_0131_0003_0001$$$::I'm amazed even just by that, but on top of that, she's smiling alongside Sakura.[lr]::
17386::$$$message_0131_0003_0002$$$::Is it a cataclysm, or is it a strange chance of fortune?::
17387::$$$message_0131_0004_0000$$$::"Hello. Sakura, you know Caster?"[lr]::
17388::$$$message_0131_0004_0001$$$::"Oh, you also know Mrs. Caster, Senpai?[lr]::
17389::$$$message_0131_0004_0002$$$::[chgfg textoff=0 storage=桜私服03e(中) time=300]Oh, if she's at Ryudou-senpai's house, then of course you would."::
17390::$$$message_0131_0005_0000$$$::"We don't need to introduce anyone to each other then.[lr]::
17391::$$$message_0131_0005_0001$$$::Hello, Emiya. I'm friends with Miss Matou."[lr]::
17392::$$$message_0131_0005_0002$$$::"Senpai is also taking care of me at his home."[lr]::
17393::$$$message_0131_0005_0003$$$::"Yes. Since we are in similar situations, [cacheimage storage=キャスター私服01c(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=キャスター私服01c(中)]we couldn't help but get lost in conversation."::
17394::$$$message_0131_0006_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
17395::$$$message_0131_0006_0001$$$::I gulp down the objection that almost came out of my throat.[lr]::
17396::$$$message_0131_0006_0002$$$::Caster is not the Caster I know.[lr]::
17397::$$$message_0131_0006_0003$$$::No matter how one looks at it, she looks like a perfect and beautiful wife from a good upbringing.[lr]::
17398::$$$message_0131_0006_0004$$$::Well, it's hard for me to accept this situation either way.::
17399::$$$message_0131_0007_0000$$$::"...Umm, hello?[lr]::
17400::$$$message_0131_0007_0001$$$::Excuse me for asking, but how did you two meet?"[lr]::
17401::$$$message_0131_0007_0002$$$::The incredible shock makes me talk like a news reporter.[lr]::
17402::$$$message_0131_0007_0003$$$::"Right, you see...!"::
17403::$$$message_0131_0008_0000$$$::"You're cute, young lady.[lr]::
17404::$$$message_0131_0008_0001$$$::What, do you call it a maid nowadays? Domestic girls are nice.[lr]::
17405::$$$message_0131_0008_0002$$$::Hey, why don't you hang out with me once you're done shopping? In fact, why don't we go around together and I carry your stuff?"::
17406::$$$message_0131_0009_0000$$$::"Uh, u-um, well, this and that is..."[lr]::
17407::$$$message_0131_0009_0001$$$::"Don't be so scared, I'm not rude enough to chew you out. Enjoying the present as much as possible is my policy. I won't make you bored, and I'll make your time so sweet that you'll never be left wanting..."::
17408::$$$message_0131_0010_0000$$$::"Stop right there, you mongrel![rf][lr]::
17409::$$$message_0131_0010_0001$$$::This is everyone's Mount Miyama shopping district. I won't let you act self-centered and do as you please like Jason; even if the church allows it, I won't allow it!"::
17410::$$$message_0131_0011_0000$$$::"Guh...it's the witch of the mountains.[lr]::
17411::$$$message_0131_0011_0001$$$::Shoo, the one I have business with is the [font italic=true]young[font italic=false] lady.[lr]::
17412::$$$message_0131_0011_0002$$$::Get it? I have nothing to give to an old lady, so get your saury and flounder and get outta here!"[lr]::
17413::$$$message_0131_0011_0003$$$::"Old...lady?"::
17414::$$$message_0131_0012_0000$$$::"Heheheheh. I couldn't hear you well, Lancer. Can you say it again?[lr]::
17415::$$$message_0131_0012_0001$$$::If you do, I'll turn you into a hot dog running around covered in fire without mercy!"::
17416::$$$message_0131_0013_0000$$$::"You have no restraint at all, you fool! You should also know your place!"[lr]::
17417::$$$message_0131_0013_0001$$$::"Come to think of it. [l][say storage=cty0416_cas_0061 name=キャスター]I'm a customer, and you're the store clerk of the fish shop, right? Customer service is enduring complaints from customers with a smile."::
17418::$$$message_0131_0014_0000$$$::"Khh, you've gotten used to shopping, you vixen...ugh, today's not my day! [l][say storage=cty0416_ran_0041 name=ランサー]So long, I can't afford to get fired anymore!"[lr]::
17419::$$$message_0131_0014_0001$$$::"Heheheh, how foolish of you, Lancer.[lr]::
17420::$$$message_0131_0014_0002$$$::You should realize that us housewives are the strongest in this shopping district...!"::
17421::$$$message_0131_0015_0000$$$::"...Now.[lr]::
17422::$$$message_0131_0015_0001$$$::Sorry for causing a commotion. Was I overstepping there, young lady?"[lr]::
17423::$$$message_0131_0015_0002$$$::"N-No, thank you![lr]::
17424::$$$message_0131_0015_0003$$$::Um, if you don't mind, can you tell me your name..."::
17425::$$$message_0131_0016_0000$$$::"...And that's how we became friends."[lr]::
17426::$$$message_0131_0016_0001$$$::"Caster, do you have a minute...?"[lr]::
17427::$$$message_0131_0016_0002$$$::I motion Caster over to the side.::
17428::$$$message_0131_0017_0000$$$::"Hey, what's going on? I appreciate that you saved Sakura, but you're not scheming anything, are you?"[lr]::
17429::$$$message_0131_0017_0001$$$::"Do not worry, I have no other intentions. I just didn't like how Lancer was being dominating here.[lr]::
17430::$$$message_0131_0017_0002$$$::I never liked men like that."[lr]::
17431::$$$message_0131_0017_0003$$$::Caster curves her lips into a bewitching smile.[lr]::
17432::$$$message_0131_0017_0004$$$::It seems like the elegant young wife doesn't lie.::
17433::$$$message_0131_0018_0000$$$::"Besides, Miss Matou is Souichirou's student, right?[lr]::
17434::$$$message_0131_0018_0001$$$::She's been kind enough to tell me all kinds of things about school."[lr]::
17435::$$$message_0131_0018_0002$$$::"...Hm. You don't talk about that kind of stuff with Issei?"::
17436::$$$message_0131_0019_0000$$$::"That boy is... He's like a brother-in-law with Souichirou, so he could be a bit more attached to me."[lr]::
17437::$$$message_0131_0019_0001$$$::"So if you marry Mr. Kuzuki, you would be Ryudou-senpai's sister-in-law!"[lr]::
17438::$$$message_0131_0019_0002$$$::Wow, Issei's trouble with women is following him for life!::
17439::$$$message_0131_0020_0000$$$::"I'm sure you two will be able to hit it off more if that happens.[lr]::
17440::$$$message_0131_0020_0001$$$::I'm jealous of Ryudou-senpai... [cacheimage storage=桜私服05e(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 storage=桜私服05e(中) pos=r time=400]Right, Senpai?"[lr]::
17441::$$$message_0131_0020_0002$$$::"...Well, yeah."[lr]::
17442::$$$message_0131_0020_0003$$$::"How nice, newlyweds are so lovely."[lr]::
17443::$$$message_0131_0020_0004$$$::"Heheheh, oh no, you're making me embarrassed."::
17444::$$$message_0131_0021_0000$$$::Caster is being humble, but she can't hide her joy.[lr]::
17445::$$$message_0131_0021_0001$$$::All right, all right, Caster. No matter how much you pretend to stay calm, your happiness is overflowing.::
17446::$$$message_0131_0022_0000$$$::"Don't you also have a lovely person too, Miss Matou?"[lr]::
17447::$$$message_0131_0022_0001$$$::"[shock vmax=20 time=300 count=-3]Huh! U-Um!"::
17448::$$$message_0131_0023_0000$$$::"Well, um... [cacheimage storage=桜私服05d頬(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=桜私服05d頬(中)]I've never been in a long-term relationship with something like m-marriage in mind, [cacheimage storage=桜私服05d頬(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=桜私服05d頬(中)]and it'll be a while until we'll be able to talk about something so personal...[lr]::
17449::$$$message_0131_0023_0001$$$::[chgfg textoff=0 storage=桜私服14c(中) pos=r time=300]That person has no parents, but I get along with their guardian, [cacheimage storage=桜私服02b頬(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=桜私服02b頬(中)]so eventually, [cacheimage storage=桜私服08a頬(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=桜私服08a頬(中)]um[line len=2]"::
17450::$$$message_0131_0024_0000$$$::Sakura flaps her arms awkwardly.[lr]::
17451::$$$message_0131_0024_0001$$$::"Hehe, how cute."[lr]::
17452::$$$message_0131_0024_0002$$$::Caster looks on with a smile.[lr]::
17453::$$$message_0131_0024_0003$$$::"..."[lr]::
17454::$$$message_0131_0024_0004$$$::As for me, I'm embarrassed, not knowing who might be listening in this familiar shopping district...::
17455::$$$message_0131_0025_0000$$$::[font italic=true]Guh, is that Rider...!?[font italic=false][lr]::
17456::$$$message_0131_0025_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
17457::$$$message_0131_0025_0002$$$::...But. Rider isn't teasing, but instead, she's peering over here like a snake that's gazing at her prey.::
17458::$$$message_0131_0026_0000$$$::"...Right? Senpai!"[lr]::
17459::$$$message_0131_0026_0001$$$::"Huh?"[lr]::
17460::$$$message_0131_0026_0002$$$::"That you were my first cooking teacher."[lr]::
17461::$$$message_0131_0026_0003$$$::"Well, I did teach you the first steps."::
17462::$$$message_0131_0027_0000$$$::"Really?[lr]::
17463::$$$message_0131_0027_0001$$$::Cooking for Souichirou is nice, but cooking together is lovely, too."::
17464::$$$message_0131_0028_0000$$$::"Souichirou, can you gut this sea bream directly shipped from Akashi?"[lr]::
17465::$$$message_0131_0028_0001$$$::"Hm, but there is no need for any weapons."::
17466::$$$message_0131_0029_0000$$$::"Oh, Souichirou![lr]::
17467::$$$message_0131_0029_0001$$$::What impressive live fish filleting for sashimi! And with your bare hands!"[lr]::
17468::$$$message_0131_0029_0002$$$::"Although it's different from gutting a live person..."::
17469::$$$message_0131_0030_0000$$$::"To think that the skills I've gained to take away lives is making food that doesn't take away lives. I shall thank you for the precious experience, Caster."::
17470::$$$message_0131_0031_0000$$$::"I don't deserve those words...[lr]::
17471::$$$message_0131_0031_0001$$$::Ah, I want to see him in an apron..."[lr]::
17472::$$$message_0131_0031_0002$$$::...I don't know why they're making sea bream sashimi at a Zen temple, but I got the vibe that I shouldn't ask such a tactless question.::
17473::$$$message_0131_0032_0000$$$::"However..."[lr]::
17474::$$$message_0131_0032_0001$$$::As I'm looking at them like this, the pairing of Sakura and Caster may not be that odd.[lr]::
17475::$$$message_0131_0032_0002$$$::One is a housewife, and one is a hard-core domestic helper.[lr]::
17476::$$$message_0131_0032_0003$$$::They're both the type to hold things in, so they may be pretty similar.::
17477::$$$message_0131_0033_0000$$$::"...Both Sakura and Caster are mages, too."[lr]::
17478::$$$message_0131_0033_0001$$$::We're in public, so I keep my voice especially low.::
17479::$$$message_0131_0034_0000$$$::"What, I'm no good at all![lr]::
17480::$$$message_0131_0034_0001$$$::Even learning from Rider, I trouble her from not improving at all. It's a big difference from you![lr]::
17481::$$$message_0131_0034_0002$$$::I can't compare to her!"::
17482::$$$message_0131_0035_0000$$$::"There's no need to be humble, you've got plenty of potential... You have some unbelievable powers stored."[lr]::
17483::$$$message_0131_0035_0001$$$::Is Caster's perception that strong?::
17484::$$$message_0131_0036_0000$$$::"Ahaha, well I was told by a certain somebody that the only asset I have is my assets, so I worry."[lr]::
17485::$$$message_0131_0036_0001$$$::...I look around.[lr]::
17486::$$$message_0131_0036_0002$$$::Is there any chance that not just Rider, but Tohsaka is also passing by...?::
17487::$$$message_0131_0037_0000$$$::"In addition to being mages, women like us have a rocky road ahead of us.[lr]::
17488::$$$message_0131_0037_0001$$$::But, I admire you for being able to build a happy home despite that. [lr]::
17489::$$$message_0131_0037_0002$$$::Yes, I will follow in your footsteps!"[lr]::
17490::$$$message_0131_0037_0003$$$::Sakura grips her fists and asserts.[lr]::
17491::$$$message_0131_0037_0004$$$::As if to say her eyes have been opened about life.::
17492::$$$message_0131_0038_0000$$$::"And even though you're an amazing mage, I respect how kind and modest you are."[lr]::
17493::$$$message_0131_0038_0001$$$::"Oh, it troubles me to be complimented that much. Even though I have so many imperfections."::
17494::$$$message_0131_0039_0000$$$::She giggles.[lr]::
17495::$$$message_0131_0039_0001$$$::It seems like she's being humble, but it also seems true.::
17496::$$$message_0131_0040_0000$$$::"...Hm, the proportion of being a mage compared to their everyday life.[lr]::
17497::$$$message_0131_0040_0001$$$::What do you think about that situation, Caster?"[lr]::
17498::$$$message_0131_0040_0002$$$::I don't know many mages, so I got a bit interested.::
17499::$$$message_0131_0041_0000$$$::"That way of thinking itself is wrong, boy.[lr]::
17500::$$$message_0131_0041_0001$$$::Magecraft and real life are mutually exclusive. The word 'proportion' itself is something you shouldn't think about.[lr]::
17501::$$$message_0131_0041_0002$$$::The root of magecraft is none other than 'distortion, retrogression.' No matter what kind of magecraft it is, it will distort the norm.[lr]::
17502::$$$message_0131_0041_0003$$$::That is why if you want to live correctly, then you should separate real life from magecraft."::
17503::$$$message_0131_0042_0000$$$::"...Does that mean you can't balance both?"[lr]::
17504::$$$message_0131_0042_0001$$$::"It means you have to balance them both completely.[lr]::
17505::$$$message_0131_0042_0002$$$::Mages are beings that go back and forth across the boundary. It's up to the user which side they want to make the main side, but you can never lose this border.[lr]::
17506::$$$message_0131_0042_0003$$$::Immersing yourself into magecraft will eliminate real life.[lr]::
17507::$$$message_0131_0042_0004$$$::If you want to pursue the path of magecraft as a human, you must be two-faced.[lr]::
17508::$$$message_0131_0042_0005$$$::Furthermore, you must decide your way of living as a person and as a mage."::
17509::$$$message_0131_0043_0000$$$::"Then, what about you?[lr]::
17510::$$$message_0131_0043_0001$$$::You're Mr. Kuzuki's wife right now, but what about you as a mage[line len=3]"::
17511::$$$message_0131_0044_0000$$$::"Of course, it's nothing different from up until now.[lr]::
17512::$$$message_0131_0044_0001$$$::I have no doubts about myself as a mage.[lr]::
17513::$$$message_0131_0044_0002$$$::I just use my power on my own terms.[lr]::
17514::$$$message_0131_0044_0003$$$::...It's just that I'm my mage self less than before."::
17515::$$$message_0131_0045_0000$$$::"I see..."[lr]::
17516::$$$message_0131_0045_0001$$$::"It's quite deep."::
17517::$$$message_0131_0046_0000$$$::"Right now, both me and Miss Sakura are women before being mages.[lr]::
17518::$$$message_0131_0046_0001$$$::But, if we have the skills to make a man look good, isn't that what you call the support of a wife?"[lr]::
17519::$$$message_0131_0046_0002$$$::"I see... So this power is something to make the people that we like happy.[lr]::
17520::$$$message_0131_0046_0003$$$::I think I will be able to work as hard at training as cooking from now on!"::
17521::$$$message_0131_0047_0000$$$::Sakura seems to be idolizing Caster, who gives off the feeling of being her senpai in life.[lr]::
17522::$$$message_0131_0047_0001$$$::...I don't know whether to say they're getting along or having a self-suggestion fest.::
17523::$$$message_0131_0048_0000$$$::"Yes, women should be like that! [cacheimage storage=桜私服06c(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 storage=桜私服06c(中) pos=r time=300]Someone like Miss Perfect isn't good!"[lr]::
17524::$$$message_0131_0048_0001$$$::"M-Miss Perfect?[lr]::
17525::$$$message_0131_0048_0002$$$::Who's that?"[lr]::
17526::$$$message_0131_0048_0003$$$::I feel like I've heard that somewhere.::
17527::$$$message_0131_0049_0000$$$::"Of course, it's Nee-[cacheimage storage=桜私服05f(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=桜私服05f(中)]T-Toh... T-[cacheimage storage=桜私服08k(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=300][chgfg textoff=0 storage=桜私服08k(中) pos=r time=300]Tohno, a girl at our rival girls' school![lr]::
17528::$$$message_0131_0049_0001$$$::People call her Miss Perfect."::
17529::$$$message_0131_0050_0000$$$::Ahh, so there's at least one person with that nickname at every school... I couldn't help but think it was about Tohsaka.[lr]::
17530::$$$message_0131_0050_0001$$$::Well, there's no way that Sakura would talk bad about her older sister, Tohsaka.::
17531::$$$message_0131_0051_0000$$$::"Oh, what kind of girl is she?"[lr]::
17532::$$$message_0131_0051_0001$$$::"Miss Perfect is terrible. Everyone is tricked by her."[lr]::
17533::$$$message_0131_0051_0002$$$::Sakura talks, giving off the aura that she is also a victim.[lr]::
17534::$$$message_0131_0051_0003$$$::...Mrgh. That spoiled girl of that rival school must've treated Sakura badly.::
17535::$$$message_0131_0052_0000$$$::"She's from a distinguished family and very pretty... Although she has no boobs.[lr]::
17536::$$$message_0131_0052_0001$$$::She's the number one honor student of her grade and secretly good at magecraft...[lr]::
17537::$$$message_0131_0052_0002$$$::Even though she's a clumsy miser at heart, she puts on a façade in public as a cutesy spoiled girl who's pretending to be calm and composed!"::
17538::$$$message_0131_0053_0000$$$::"Wow."[lr]::
17539::$$$message_0131_0053_0001$$$::I didn't think there would be two or three walking singularities in this universe.[lr]::
17540::$$$message_0131_0053_0002$$$::Should I say that the world is wide or Japan is narrow?::
17541::$$$message_0131_0054_0000$$$::"Plus, she's got a job lined up as a cosmopolitan businesswoman traveling abroad and doing whatever she wants like a 40-centimeter cannon!"[lr]::
17542::$$$message_0131_0054_0001$$$::"Hmm... She's got quite a mask on.[lr]::
17543::$$$message_0131_0054_0002$$$::That's rough, having a girl like that as a rival."::
17544::$$$message_0131_0055_0000$$$::"Y-Yes![lr]::
17545::$$$message_0131_0055_0001$$$::She's ladylike, so everyone gets fooled, even though she doesn't have any boobs!"[lr]::
17546::$$$message_0131_0055_0002$$$::"Sakura, her boobs aside, can you continue...?"[lr]::
17547::$$$message_0131_0055_0003$$$::"Y-Yes, putting her boobs aside..."::
17548::$$$message_0131_0056_0000$$$::"Her personality is actually like a rollercoaster, and those around her or those who got on without thinking get in big trouble.[lr]::
17549::$$$message_0131_0056_0001$$$::But it's high-functioning without a complaint, so the people at the amusement park can't say anything or they cry themselves to sleep. They can't maintain the popularity of the amusement park without that person... It's that kind of fear we all have... I mean, we all like Miss Perfect..."::
17550::$$$message_0131_0057_0000$$$::"...That isn't someone else's problem anymore, huh?"[lr]::
17551::$$$message_0131_0057_0001$$$::You're making some interesting comparisons, Sakura.::
17552::$$$message_0131_0058_0000$$$::"B-But the biggest problem is that she's turned an innocent boy into a deboned servant![lr]::
17553::$$$message_0131_0058_0001$$$::E-Even I want to do the same thing at least once if I can!"[lr]::
17554::$$$message_0131_0058_0002$$$::"Oh. That girl's not bad."::
17555::$$$message_0131_0059_0000$$$::"N-No![lr]::
17556::$$$message_0131_0059_0001$$$::Um, that boy seems to have gotten used to it lately and seems to enjoy being used by Miss Perfect.[lr]::
17557::$$$message_0131_0059_0002$$$::But, forcing isn't good, you know! I think that doing things like that is very bad!"::
17558::$$$message_0131_0060_0000$$$::An aura of determination erupts from Sakura.[lr]::
17559::$$$message_0131_0060_0001$$$::I get prompted to take a step or two back.::
17560::$$$message_0131_0061_0000$$$::"I-I see. Sakura, you're, um.[lr]::
17561::$$$message_0131_0061_0001$$$::V-Very kind."[lr]::
17562::$$$message_0131_0061_0002$$$::I try to force a smile.::
17563::$$$message_0131_0062_0000$$$::"Yes! So, I also want to aim to be a good, ladylike wife like you, Caster!"[lr]::
17564::$$$message_0131_0062_0001$$$::"Ah, I see. [lr]::
17565::$$$message_0131_0062_0002$$$::Do you want to make that boy happy?"::
17566::$$$message_0131_0063_0000$$$::"Uh... Um, I think [cacheimage storage=桜私服08f頬(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg  storage=桜私服08f頬(中) pos=r time=300]that things can't stay as they are, so I should do something, but[line len=2]"[lr]::
17567::$$$message_0131_0063_0001$$$::"But, you have Emiya."[lr]::
17568::$$$message_0131_0063_0002$$$::"Oh[wvl canskip=0 time=400]...well, [cacheimage storage=桜私服13b頬(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=300][chgfg storage=桜私服13b頬(中) pos=r time=300]that is..."::
17569::$$$message_0131_0064_0000$$$::"Although I appreciate your determination to become like me.[lr]::
17570::$$$message_0131_0064_0001$$$::[chgfg textoff=0 storage=キャスター私服01b(中) pos=l time=300]It is not good to simply copy the way that I am."[lr]::
17571::$$$message_0131_0064_0002$$$::"Oh... Yes."::
17572::$$$message_0131_0065_0000$$$::"I also have parts of me that are bad, so use those as good examples of what not to do. No one else has to fall for a bad guy..."[lr]::
17573::$$$message_0131_0065_0001$$$::I feel chills down my spine from being glared at by Caster's almond eyes.::
17574::$$$message_0131_0066_0000$$$::"You're not a bad guy, right?"[lr]::
17575::$$$message_0131_0066_0001$$$::"Um, Senpai is a good person! There's no doubt about it!"[lr]::
17576::$$$message_0131_0066_0002$$$::"Maybe. You lucky boy, this girl will make you happy..."[lr]::
17577::$$$message_0131_0066_0003$$$::"..."[lr]::
17578::$$$message_0131_0066_0004$$$::I hesitate, unsure how to answer.::
17579::$$$message_0131_0067_0000$$$::"Miss Matou, you have no need to worry about Miss Perfect.[lr]::
17580::$$$message_0131_0067_0001$$$::What's important is you and your special someone."::
17581::$$$message_0131_0068_0000$$$::"Y-Yes...![lr]::
17582::$$$message_0131_0068_0001$$$::Ah, you are such a lovely wife after all, Caster. What a big difference from Miss Perfect...![lr]::
17583::$$$message_0131_0068_0002$$$::Wahh, you're making me cry...!"::
17584::$$$message_0131_0069_0000$$$::Is this what you call being moved to tears?[lr]::
17585::$$$message_0131_0069_0001$$$::Even without any incantations, Caster's words have as much destructive power as her Rule Breaker.[lr]::
17586::$$$message_0131_0069_0002$$$::Anyway, I'm glad that it seems like Sakura's various worries have been solved.::
17587::$$$message_0131_0070_0000$$$::"Can I call you my big sister, Caster?"[lr]::
17588::$$$message_0131_0070_0001$$$::"Oh. I got a cute little sister."::
17589::$$$message_0131_0071_0000$$$::"S-Sakura... Your older sister is[line len=2]"[lr]::
17590::$$$message_0131_0071_0001$$$::"Senpai, let's invite Caster to our home next time and listen to her useful advice![lr]::
17591::$$$message_0131_0071_0002$$$::Especially about how to deal with Miss Perfect!"::
17592::$$$message_0131_0072_0000$$$::"What a pleasant invite. I shall think about it.[lr]::
17593::$$$message_0131_0072_0001$$$::Oh, that's right, can you come shopping with me too, Emiya?"[lr]::
17594::$$$message_0131_0072_0002$$$::"Doesn't that sound great, Senpai? Let's decide on our lunch menu!"::
17595::$$$message_0131_0073_0000$$$::"Y-Yeah, I was planning on it from the start, so we can."[lr]::
17596::$$$message_0131_0073_0001$$$::...Something doesn't feel right, but this isn't a situation where I can say no.[lr]::
17597::$$$message_0131_0073_0002$$$::Sakura, who is in high spirits, and Caster, who looks happier than ever.[lr]::
17598::$$$message_0131_0073_0003$$$::...The peaceful yet suffocating time, which feels like I'm being choked by floss silk, continues...::
917408::$$$message_9131_0010_0000$$$::"Stop right there, you mongrel!"[r]::